  "name": "Waste Sorting",
  "name_zh": "垃圾分类",
  "description": "Waste classification on the camera itself. Each frame is resized short-side 256, centre-cropped to 224 and classified by EfficientNet-Lite0 on the RV1126B NPU into eight material classes (paper, cardboard, glass, metal, plastic, textile, organic, residual); the Chinese four-bin category (recyclable / kitchen / hazardous / residual) is a lookup on top of the material class, not a second model head. A class is published only after it holds for a configurable number of consecutive frames above a confidence floor, then re-published on a heartbeat and retried after a delivery failure, so a bag moving through the frame produces one record rather than a burst. Every record is the same MQTT event shape this project publishes on TensorRT, Hailo and the SG2002 build -- top-3 with per-class confidence, the material and four-bin category, inference time, the ONNX hash and the RKNN artifact hash -- validated against the contract on the publish path itself. Images never leave the device: the payload carries a reference, never pixels. On a 1060-image validation subset the INT8 model agreed with the CPU reference on 99.06% of images at a 5.8 ms median inference time.",
  "description_zh": "分类在摄像头上完成。每一帧短边缩到 256、中心裁 224，由 EfficientNet-Lite0 在 RV1126B NPU 上判成八个物料类（纸、纸板、玻璃、金属、塑料、织物、厨余、其他）；中国生活垃圾四分类（可回收物 / 厨余垃圾 / 有害垃圾 / 其他垃圾）是在物料类之上查表得到的，不是模型的第二个头。一个类别要连续若干帧高于置信度下限才会发出，之后按心跳重发、投递失败按间隔补发，因此一个袋子经过画面产出的是一条记录而不是一串。每条记录与本项目在 TensorRT、Hailo 与 SG2002 上发的是同一个 MQTT 事件形状——top-3 及各自置信度、物料类与四分类、推理耗时、ONNX 哈希与 RKNN 制品哈希——并在发布路径上按契约校验。图片不出设备：payload 里只有引用，没有像素。在 1060 张验证子集上，INT8 模型与 CPU 参考的一致率 99.06%，推理时延中位数 5.8 ms。",
  "author": "Seeed edge-waste-sorting",
  "image": "/appcenter/apps/waste-sorting.png",
  "icon": {
    "path": "icon.png",
    "media_type": "image/png"
  },
